  "notes": "A notification bell on the computer and the phone holds update notices and alerts (no more yellow notes in the chat). Falcor chat opens on a new chat with Falcor's greeting; the phone's chat works like a mobile chat app with a slide-out list of past chats. Guides open from each game, task, the chat or Settings → Knowledge. Auto-capture game details reads a whole offer page by itself. The Sandbox opens on Create and My sequences (with Duplicate and Delete on the phone). Uniform game icons.",
